{"id": "EUVD-2026-67584", "enisaUuid": "89055cd5-d4c9-389d-8112-409a3f379242", "description": "SvelteKit versions from 2.38.0 before 2.60.1 contain a race condition in query.batch that allows concurrent requests from different users to merge under a single request context. Attackers can exploit specific timing conditions to access sensitive data from other users' concurrent requests.", "datePublished": "2026-08-28T10:49:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:25:30", "baseScore": 5.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/sveltejs/kit/security/advisories/GHSA-hgv7-v322-mmgr", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/sveltekit-2.38.0-before-2.60.1-cross-user-data-disclosure-via-query-batch"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m99x-q38g-c4c6", "CVE-2026-82258"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3358e606-d4dd-3056-b2dc-2be8ff2bb44b", "product": {"name": "kit", "vendor": {"name": "sveltejs"}}, "product_version": "2.38.0 <2.60.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e2e37822-b47b-33b2-b78a-833e94862490", "vendor": {"name": "sveltejs"}}], "isExploited": false}